00:17:19,320 --> 00:17:23,800
I've observed Yugi's past duels very
carefully, and I know what he's up to.

247
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:27,557
One of his face-down cards will
make his Dark Magician stronger,

248
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:31,160
and he'll use the other one
to stop my Blue Eyes attack.

249
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:32,940
Sorry, Yugi,

250
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:36,277
but this little strategy of
yours is no secret to me,

251
00:17:36,360 --> 00:17:38,777
so I'm afraid it's not going to work.

252
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:43,280
You're planning to take me down
with your two face-down cards.

253
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:44,960
Well, guess what?

254
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,520
I've got a plan, too.

255
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:48,220
Behold this!

256
00:17:48,620 --> 00:17:51,860
A monster that will
seal your fate! Oh, no!

257
00:17:52,140 --> 00:17:54,520
I summon Lord of Dragons!

258
00:17:55,260 --> 00:18:00,680
As long as it's on the field, my Blue Eyes
is safe from all magic and trap cards!

259
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:02,420
That may be so, Kaiba,

260
00:18:02,660 --> 00:18:06,417
but my Dark Magician is more
powerful than your Lord of Dragons!

261
00:18:06,500 --> 00:18:09,220
Then go ahead and attack it, Yugi.

262
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:15,100
Kaiba may have a plan to stop my attack,
but in order to win, I'll have to try.

263
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,060
All right, my move.

264
00:18:17,380 --> 00:18:21,220
I summon Beta, the Magnet
Warrior, in defense mode.

265
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,540
Come on, Yugi.

266
00:18:26,020 --> 00:18:28,240
Attack me with your Dark Magician.

267
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:33,020
Dark Magician, attack
his Lord of Dragons now!

268
00:18:36,500 --> 00:18:37,660
Too bad, Yu-Gi.

269
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:40,620
I reveal my trap card.

270
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:43,200
Magical trick mirror.

271
00:18:43,780 --> 00:18:49,920
Now I can take one magic card from your
graveyard and use it as my own for one turn.

272
00:18:50,300 --> 00:18:55,020
And I know exactly which one of your
old cards I need to get my hands on.

273
00:18:55,700 --> 00:18:56,940
Monster reborn.

274
00:18:57,620 --> 00:18:58,700
And why's that?

275
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:03,140
Now I can bring back an old friend.

276
00:19:03,860 --> 00:19:04,690
Behold!

277
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:07,780
The rebirth of my Egyptian God card!

278
00:19:08,540 --> 00:19:09,900
It's Obelisk!

279
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:11,600
Very observant, Yugi.

280
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:15,820
But Egyptian God cards can
only be revived for one turn!

281
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:21,540
True, but one turn is all I need to block
your Dark Magician's attack! Hold on!

282
00:19:22,760 --> 00:19:23,590
Too late!

283
00:19:23,900 --> 00:19:26,820
It's time for Obelisk
to absorb your attack!

284
00:19:28,820 --> 00:19:29,997
This can't be!

285
00:19:30,080 --> 00:19:33,360
Say goodbye to 1,500 life points.

286
00:19:37,740 --> 00:19:40,920
It looks to me like you're out of options.

287
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:43,837
It's over.
